  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000007502', $m$codigo$m$, $m$SP4-460-005$m$, NULL, $m$MTF: 0(Off) 1-15 (Weak ± Strong) Sets the MTF level (Modulation Transfer Function) designed to improve image contrast. Set higher for stronger effect, lower for weaker effect.$m$, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $m$[0 to 15/8/1]$m$),
