  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000007502', $m$codigo$m$, $m$SP4-460-009$m$, NULL, $m$Ind Dot Erase: 0(Off) 1-7 (Weak ± Strong) This SP sets the level for removing dots when a color original is scanned with a scanner software application. The higher the setting, the greater the effect applied for removing background dots.$m$, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $m$[0 to 7/0/1]$m$),
