  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000007502', $m$codigo$m$, $m$SP5-490$m$, NULL, $m$MF Key Card$m$, NULL, NULL, NULL, $m$Sets operation of the MF key card. [0 to 1/0/1] 1: Allowed 0: Not allowed 1: Certification executes with a user code (9999 9999). Printing executes and the counter increments for the user code. 0: Certification executes without a user code but printing is cancelled.$m$, $m$[0 to 1/0/1]$m$),
