  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000007502', $m$codigo$m$, $m$SP5-501$m$, NULL, $m$PM Alarm$m$, NULL, NULL, NULL, $m$Sets the count level for the PM alarm. [0 to 9999 / 0 / 1] 0: Alarm disabled The PM alarm goes off when the print count reaches this value multiplied by 1,000.$m$, $m$[0 to 9999 / 0 / 1]$m$),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000007502', $m$codigo$m$, $m$SP5-504$m$, NULL, $m$Jam Alarm Japan Only$m$, NULL, NULL, NULL, $m$Sets the alarm to sound for the specified jam level (document misfeeds are not included). RSS use only [0 to 3 / 3 / 1 step] 0: Zero (Off) 1: Low (2.5K jams) 2: Medium (3K jams) 3: High (6K jams)$m$, $m$[0 to 3 / 3 / 1 step]$m$),
